{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルに意味はない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます！\n伊藤純奈です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/22/6283222/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物販で売ってる生写真。\n浴衣。この浴衣かわいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/22/6283222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15thアンダー曲\n『シークレットグラフィティー』\nのMVが公開されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちま演じる樋口くんを\n奪い合うわたしたち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/22/6283222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華軍さん率いる\n「ひぐちを愛する友の会」！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い三つ編みなんてしてこんな\nいかつい表情。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/07/22/6283222/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんは樋口くんに助けてもらいたくて\nわざとこけるシーンがありました(・ω・)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝イチの撮影で転がるじゅんな。\nスタッフさんが動画まわしながら\nめっちゃ笑ってて、ひなちまとも\n笑いをこらえながら頑張りました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざとらしく転んでって監督さんに\n言われたので頑張ってやってたら\nジャージが泥だらけになっちゃって\nほんとごめんなさいでしたヽ(；▽；)ノ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも『樋口発声練習』とか\n面白いシーンがたくさんあるし、\nひたすらひなちまが可愛いので\nみてください〜〜♡"},{"type":"break